The great Arai Hakuseki-sensei said that

00:19:30.950 --> 00:19:33.430
dishonor is like a cut in a tree's trunk.

00:19:33.430 --> 00:19:37.680
Time does not erase it, 
it only makes it worse.

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:45.160
And yet you were about to ruin 
everything with a single mistake.

00:19:45.590 --> 00:19:49.140
Even a small mistake may, with time,

00:19:49.140 --> 00:19:51.820
become a great problem, 
like a cut in a tree.

00:19:52.770 --> 00:19:55.840
You were just telling me how splendidly I did.

00:19:57.230 --> 00:19:59.260
This and that are different matters.

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:03.020
Um... about the money I 
paid for the both of us...

00:20:03.020 --> 00:20:04.050
Silence.

00:20:04.050 --> 00:20:07.510
Oh, my. You're really putting 
the squeeze on him.

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:08.560
Yes.

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:11.770
He was right where you 
said he'd be, Otomi-san.

00:20:12.130 --> 00:20:13.570
Huh? Grannie?

00:20:13.570 --> 00:20:18.650
Sorry. I told them to let me 
know if you showed up.

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:21.550
You old hag!

00:20:21.550 --> 00:20:23.740
Keiichiro!

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:28.530
Wh-What are you doing here?

00:20:33.610 --> 00:20:38.350
She wanted a job, so I hired her as a maid.

00:20:38.350 --> 00:20:41.590
Having a young girl like her 
brings in more customers.

00:20:42.450 --> 00:20:44.240
Stop it! Let go of me!

00:20:45.950 --> 00:20:49.310
Weren't you working at that other place?

00:20:49.730 --> 00:20:51.990
No, I quit.

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:56.020
I forgot to mention this...

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:58.850
I worked at that place,

00:20:58.850 --> 00:21:00.980
but I'm actually still a virgin.

00:21:07.270 --> 00:21:08.370
What was that for?

00:21:10.350 --> 00:21:14.660
Don't get too close to Keiichiro-sama.

00:21:15.220 --> 00:21:17.290
What did you say?

00:21:17.950 --> 00:21:23.260
It is my job to protect Keiichiro-sama 
from bad influences.

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:25.890
And your slatternly behavior

00:21:25.890 --> 00:21:28.680
does not seem to me like 
a healthy influence at all.

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:31.280
What?

00:21:33.200 --> 00:21:34.800
Look at them go!

00:21:34.800 --> 00:21:37.100
It's so scary.

00:21:37.840 --> 00:21:42.830
<i>The flames beneath the icy words they 
exchanged burned hotter than magma.</i>

00:21:42.830 --> 00:21:49.200
<i>What will become of Tokugawa Keiichiro, 
the young heir surrounded by women?</i>

00:23:26.450 --> 00:23:29.030
The mysterious girl with the 
huge rack attacks again!

00:23:29.030 --> 00:23:30.970
And another suspicious ninja 
with huge boobs, too!

00:23:30.970 --> 00:23:32.800
Do guys like big tits that much?

00:23:32.800 --> 00:23:35.590
Next time, it's more giant ta-tas 
that will decide the fate of Japan!

00:23:35.470 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>Next Time:
The Sex Witch Houkouin Strikes!</b>

00:23:35.590 --> 00:23:37.460
I'll teach you how great small boobs can be.

00:23:37.460 --> 00:23:38.920
Not happening.
